00:11:15.780 --> 00:11:20.830
Executive session is uh something that is covered by the Alabama Open Meetings

00:11:20.830 --> 00:11:28.150
Act founded Section 3625A7 of the Code of Alabama which provides that executive

00:11:28.150 --> 00:11:31.869
sessions may be held by the council but only for the purposes.

00:11:32.309 --> 00:11:35.580
Enunciated therein, there are some ones listed.

00:11:35.630 --> 00:11:38.830
The pertinent provision for our consideration tonight,

00:11:39.150 --> 00:11:42.559
for my opinion, is found at subdivision A3,

00:11:42.950 --> 00:11:48.150
which is to discuss with the council's attorney the legal ramifications

00:11:48.150 --> 00:11:49.609
of and legal.

00:11:49.859 --> 00:11:56.820
Options for pending litigation or for controversies not yet being litigated

00:11:56.820 --> 00:12:02.419
but imminently likely to be litigated or imminently likely to be litigated

00:12:02.419 --> 00:12:07.630
if the government body pursues a particular or proposed course of action

00:12:08.460 --> 00:12:12.119
before you go into executive session, the law requires,

00:12:12.460 --> 00:12:18.299
uh, that the governmental body shall receive either a written or oral declaration.

00:12:18.530 --> 00:12:23.450
That will be reflected in the minutes from an attorney licensed to practice

00:12:23.450 --> 00:12:29.849
law in Alabama uh that this exception is applicable to that plan discussion

00:12:30.140 --> 00:12:35.669
and I for the purposes of that requirement am a lawyer practiced for a long,

00:12:35.679 --> 00:12:40.929
long time in the state of Alabama so I've been licensed uh for sure uh and

00:12:40.929 --> 00:12:45.809
I confirmed this item does fall within the exception that we just discussed

00:12:45.809 --> 00:12:47.809
allowing executive sessions.

00:12:48.280 --> 00:12:52.270
Uh, and, uh, that, uh, I'm qualified to make that,

00:12:52.650 --> 00:12:53.549
that determination.

00:12:54.530 --> 00:12:56.489
So if you would ask for a motion, thank you,

00:12:56.530 --> 00:12:56.909
Mr.

00:12:56.919 --> 00:12:57.289
Riley.

00:12:57.450 --> 00:13:01.190
