00:17:39.229 --> 00:17:40.579
Community Development is seeking your authorization.

00:17:40.895 --> 00:17:42.685
To abate this junk public nuisance.

00:17:43.005 --> 00:17:45.285
The condition of the property is before you on the video screen,

00:17:45.464 --> 00:17:48.244
including photos from when the property was initially determined to be a

00:17:48.244 --> 00:17:48.895
nuisance.

00:17:49.204 --> 00:17:52.255
