01:07:00.449 --> 01:07:01.870
Good evening, City Council.

01:07:02.209 --> 01:07:05.639
I am an Alabama native who graduated high school and college here.

01:07:06.169 --> 01:07:07.510
Name and address for the record, please.

01:07:07.840 --> 01:07:10.250
Christopher Bulware, 119 Rebecca Pines Drive,

01:07:10.360 --> 01:07:11.090
Madison, Alabama.

01:07:11.250 --> 01:07:11.689
Thank you.

01:07:12.780 --> 01:07:14.780
I've lived in 5 states across this country.

01:07:14.899 --> 01:07:18.780
I've seen enough to know that Huntsville is a special place and one worth

01:07:18.780 --> 01:07:19.379
preserving.

01:07:20.169 --> 01:07:23.649
That's why I'm here to address what I consider a travesty against American

01:07:23.649 --> 01:07:29.290
freedoms AI powered automated license plate readers with flock safety as

01:07:29.290 --> 01:07:33.300
the infamous market leader marketed to eliminate crime.

01:07:33.959 --> 01:07:38.449
This technology is dragnet surveillance, paving the road to a surveillance

01:07:38.449 --> 01:07:38.770
state.

01:07:39.629 --> 01:07:43.709
Alabama now ranks 6th nationally in these cameras per capita.

01:07:46.360 --> 01:07:48.199
Flock claims that it makes communities safer,

01:07:48.780 --> 01:07:53.459
but a leaked internal tool called OS Investigate showed these systems can

01:07:53.459 --> 01:07:56.719
correlate plate scans with data broker information.

01:07:57.260 --> 01:08:01.379
Social Security numbers, phone numbers, relatives performing what Flock

01:08:01.379 --> 01:08:03.840
itself calls a one command background check.

01:08:05.000 --> 01:08:09.169
Another tool, convoy analysis, flags vehicles traveling together,

01:08:09.350 --> 01:08:12.399
letting police monitor who regularly gathers,

01:08:12.530 --> 01:08:15.169
whether a criminal ring or simply neighbors,

01:08:15.290 --> 01:08:16.589
coworkers, or protesters.

01:08:17.330 --> 01:08:21.990
With 20 billion scans per month, you'd assume that Flock protects the data,

01:08:22.490 --> 01:08:23.259
and that's wrong.

01:08:23.810 --> 01:08:27.819
Researchers gained root access to a camera in under 30 seconds with a ladder.

01:08:28.399 --> 01:08:30.350
Credentials transmit in clear text.

01:08:30.828 --> 01:08:36.167
And the cameras violate 8 of 10 industry internet security standards.

01:08:36.738 --> 01:08:39.929
Flock doesn't even require multi-factor authentication,

01:08:40.349 --> 01:08:43.929
and Flock logins have been found for sale on Russian,

01:08:44.028 --> 01:08:47.568
uh, cybercrime forums, and the public is responding.

01:08:47.948 --> 01:08:51.568
At least 54 cities have canceled their flock contracts and 26 alone,

01:08:52.108 --> 01:08:55.707
including the LAPD, after an audit showed a 1 in 3 chance of pulling over

01:08:55.707 --> 01:08:56.707
an innocent person.

01:08:57.700 --> 01:08:59.370
The opposition is bipartisan.

01:08:59.750 --> 01:09:03.350
Uh, Governor DeSantis recently said that the cameras are out of control.

01:09:03.709 --> 01:09:08.189
Congressman, uh, Burchett from Tennessee introduced HR 9800 to cut federal

01:09:08.189 --> 01:09:08.529
funding.

01:09:09.200 --> 01:09:13.589
And make no, uh, mistake, protecting Americans from AI overreach and mass

01:09:13.589 --> 01:09:17.990
surveillance has become one of the biggest issues voters use as their North

01:09:17.990 --> 01:09:21.149
Star at the ballot box for Huntsville.

01:09:21.229 --> 01:09:22.930
This is a national security issue.

01:09:23.410 --> 01:09:25.770
We are one of the largest defense hubs in the nation,

01:09:26.009 --> 01:09:30.759
and foreign adversaries can buy stolen login credentials for a few $100

01:09:31.290 --> 01:09:33.330
map the vehicles of our defense contractors,

01:09:33.410 --> 01:09:37.950
trace them home, and profile cleared personnel for blackmail in minutes

01:09:37.950 --> 01:09:38.910
with no warrant.

01:09:40.390 --> 01:09:41.549
Our founders warned us.

01:09:41.709 --> 01:09:44.950
James Madison said there are more instances of the abridgment of the freedom

01:09:44.950 --> 01:09:49.109
of people by gradual and silent encroachments by those in power than by

01:09:49.109 --> 01:09:53.310
violent and sudden usurpations, and Benjamin Franklin said those who would

01:09:53.310 --> 01:09:56.790
give up essential liberty to purchase a little temporary safety deserve

01:09:56.790 --> 01:09:58.189
neither liberty or safety.

01:09:58.509 --> 01:10:02.720
I asked his council to cancel Flock's contract and pass a local ordinance

01:10:02.720 --> 01:10:06.089
requiring warrants for any mass surveillance data.

01:10:07.410 --> 01:10:08.089
Thank you.

01:10:08.569 --> 01:10:09.290
Thank you, sir.

